## Design philosophy (Coda-inspired)

The mentorOS shell follows Coda visual language:
- Crisp white canvas with warm amber-glow sections for hero and footer
- Strong Montserrat 700 display headlines with tight negative letter-spacing
- Inter for all body, navigation, and UI text
- Obsidian (#000000) for primary CTAs — not blue
- Monochrome base palette with product-specific color accents only on product elements
- Generous spacing — Coda uses 113px between sections
- Cards use subtle shadow, NOT heavy borders
- Buttons are always 8px border-radius — never pill, never sharp

