## Typography rules

Font families:
- font-display (Montserrat 700)       ALL major headings, hero titles, product names
- font-body (Inter 400/600/700)       ALL body, nav, buttons, badges, UI labels
- font-serif (Playfair Display 300)   Optional elegant subheadings — use sparingly

Type scale:

text-display      72px   Montserrat 700   tracking-[-0.045px]   Hero headline only
text-heading-lg   52px   Montserrat 700   tracking-[-0.035px]   Major section titles
text-heading      38px   Montserrat 700   tracking-[-0.025px]   Section headings
text-heading-sm   22px   Inter 600        tracking-[-0.03px]    Card titles
text-subheading   20px   Inter 600        tracking-[-0.01px]    Feature labels
text-body         16px   Inter 400        tracking-[0.01px]     Body paragraphs
text-body-sm      14px   Inter 400        tracking-[0.01px]     Secondary text
text-caption      10px   Inter 700        uppercase             Labels, tags

ALWAYS apply the correct letter-spacing for display and heading sizes.

## Spacing rules

Base unit: 4px. Always use multiples.

Section vertical padding:   py-[113px] on desktop, py-60 on mobile
Card padding:               p-16
Element gap:                gap-8

## Border radius rules — STRICT

Cards:            8px    rounded-md
Buttons:          8px    rounded-md
Icon containers:  44px   rounded-pill
Badges and tags:  4px    rounded-sm
Full circle:      9999px rounded-full

NEVER use rounded-lg (12px), rounded-xl, rounded-2xl, or rounded-full for cards or buttons.
The Coda standard is strictly 8px for all interactive containers.

## Shadow rules — use ONLY these custom tokens:

Feature cards:      shadow-card     rgba(0,0,0,0.06) 0px 12px 24px -5px, rgba(0,0,0,0.06) 0px 5px 10px -6px
Modals overlays:    shadow-modal    rgba(0,0,0,0.06) 0px 18px 36px -6px, rgba(0,0,0,0.06) 0px 6px 12px -6px
Ghost btn focus:    shadow-subtle   rgb(33,33,33) 0px 0px 0px 1.5px inset
Soft border card:   shadow-subtle-2 rgb(224,224,224) 0px 0px 0px 1.5px inset
Decorative block:   shadow-block    rgb(0,0,0) 8px 8px 0px 0px

NEVER use Tailwind default shadow, shadow-sm, shadow-md, shadow-lg, shadow-xl.

## Button rules

Primary CTA (shell):
  bg-obsidian text-white-canvas font-semibold text-body-sm rounded-md px-20 py-12
  Hover: opacity-90
  Never use blue or purple as primary CTA on the shell

Ghost secondary:
  bg-transparent text-midnight-ink border border-midnight-ink font-semibold text-body-sm rounded-md px-12 py-8
  Hover: bg-midnight-ink/5

Product CTA (inside product cards only):
  Use product gradient: bg-gradient-pmp text-white rounded-md

## Surface and section rules

Three levels:
1. bg-white-canvas         default page background
2. bg-amber-glow           hero, footer, accent blocks
3. bg-white-canvas shadow-card   elevated cards

Use amber-glow sparingly: hero and/or footer only, max 2 sections per page.

